  "description": "Watch your background jobs log in real time. Colored, severity-coded output right on the Hangfire Dashboard — no more tailing log files to debug a recurring job. Integrates with ILogger<T> so your existing logging calls appear on the job console without any code changes. Use the PerformContext accessor pattern to scope log output to the running job.",
